"text": "The boot smoke runs as a minted session (cleanup, boot, status, cleanup). No live leg against a real CLI. Every leg drives the fake agent through the harness, so there is no `round` probe. The Windows-only measurements (CARRY §8 `^Z`, CARRY §9 focus reports) cannot run on this Linux host. Their witness is the operator pass's CI read on `windows-2025` (`tests/tui_wheel.rs` runs on all three legs), and their red-before half rests on the source read named in research.md. Mutation is the epoch-boundary audit's (testing.md 2026-10-04). The walk-class witness is the header that every `gate.py run` of this block prints. The probe entry below counts the marks independently."
}
